<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>This function removes the given item from inventory by it's resource. If nNumToRemove is specified, it will remove that many items from inventory, or as many items as it can until no more exist in inventory.
</p><p><br />
</p><p><br />
